  "content": "<p style=\"display: flex;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 135px;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/257/beachmodded.gif\" alt=\"With Pretty Beaches\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"> <img style=\"margin-left: 8px;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/328/flooding.gif\" alt=\"Flooding\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left: 8px;\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"Requires Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/sponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left: 26px;\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Support on Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>此模組調整在靠近水域挖沙時的流體物理效果，試圖避免水流出不雅觀的情形。這意味著您可以挖走需要的沙，而不必擔心破壞環境外觀。</p>\n<p>本模组适用于 NeoForge、Fabric 和 Forge。它需要 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Balm</a>，必須與本模组一同安裝。</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"Features\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>在水中旁邊打破沙子會立即創造水源區塊</li>\n<li>當沙子被挖起時，水會湧入附近的孔洞</li>\n<li>不再有被流動的沖走的後遺症或留下不自然的挖掘痕跡</li>\n<li>因為此模组免費生成水資源，因此不適合應用於水量需限制的場合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1001/697/meme.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"592\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
